' un-bien presence daemon launcher — runs node hidden (no console window) and
' tees stdout+stderr to {LOG} so crashes are diagnosable (Task Scheduler gives
' the hidden process no console, mirroring launchd/systemd log redirection).
' `cmd /c` is required for the `>>` redirection. Run(cmd, 0, True): window
' style 0 = hidden, wait = True so wscript stays alive for node's lifetime →
' Task Scheduler's RestartOnFailure still monitors the presence daemon.
' WScript.Quit propagates node's exit code.
Dim rc
rc = CreateObject("Wscript.Shell").Run("cmd /c """"{NODE}"" ""{PRESENCE}"" >> ""{LOG}"" 2>&1""", 0, True)
WScript.Quit rc
